+without implementation approval or the docs phase. If final review blocks the fix, stop the
+attempt rather than requesting a human re-decision. A changed, reviewed tree can be pushed to
+the same PR; no attempt can merge it. Each admitted nonterminal outcome opens a new
+`pr.human_review` occurrence. A verified merge or close supersedes an active repair and
+opens no replacement gate.
